"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:MothersDayArtwork2023.jpg","caption":"День матери 2023"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:RighttchiMangaFromGOGO%E2%99%AATamagotchi!.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/cc/RighttchiMangaFromGOGO%E2%99%AATamagotchi%21.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20190505200207","caption":"Иллюстрация из манги · Ригхттчи"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/b8/b85c8322e3b6b4bb79cf.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tamagotchi30thAnniversary_ArtBanner.png","caption":"Баннер к 30-летию Tamagotchi"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:RIGHTCHI.PNG","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/8e/RIGHTCHI.PNG/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20131123104432","caption":"Профиль Righttchi на TamagotchiFriends.com","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/8e/RIGHTCHI.PNG/revision/latest?cb=20131123104432"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Rightphotoimage.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/6a/Rightphotoimage.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20150102233031","caption":"Righttchi как фотограф","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/6a/Rightphotoimage.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150102233031"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:37598748975-0006.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/52/37598748975-0006.png/revision/latest?cb=20181101194538","caption":"Из альбома «Ригхттчи» · № 14"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Righttchi.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/b0/Righttchi.png/revision/latest?cb=20140718211346","caption":"Крупный план, средний (Друзья)"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Righttchi_happy_tamagotchi_p%27s.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/16/Righttchi_happy_tamagotchi_p%27s.png/revision/latest?cb=20140829154717","caption":"Крупный план (П)"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Hikarutchi.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/87/Hikarutchi.png/revision/latest?cb=20250527220818","caption":"Hikarutchi (П)"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Badtz.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/7/74/Badtz.png/revision/latest?cb=20250527220402","caption":"Правый Badtz-Maru (П)"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:MaharajaRight.PNG","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/0b/MaharajaRight.PNG/revision/latest?cb=20250527200423","caption":"Махараджа Правый (П)"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:JuniorRight.PNG","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/20/JuniorRight.PNG/revision/latest?cb=20250527200932","caption":"Младший правый (P)"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:MaharajaRightMeetsSprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/f4/MaharajaRightMeetsSprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20220702030904","caption":"Махараджа Райт (встречается)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Righttchi_sprite_friends.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/83/Righttchi_sprite_friends.png/revision/latest?cb=20150109073417","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Ригхттчи","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Raitotchi-sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/08/Raitotchi-sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20130810094007","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Ригхттчи","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Righttchimix.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/7/7a/Righttchimix.png/revision/latest?cb=20240806195202","caption":"На изображении · Ригхттчи"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Smileright.png.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.noco